Qiushui!

02:05.540 --> 02:06.430
Xiao Qiushui!

02:12.190 --> 02:13.910
Awak tak takut mati ke?

02:14.750 --> 02:17.480
Geng Kuasa telah
mencelakai keluarga Xiao saya,

02:18.170 --> 02:20.280
